Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,What if the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:01.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Titans were their
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:03.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,actual mascots, raccoons,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.52,0:00:04.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,one rip, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:05.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,the whole roster
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.22,0:00:06.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,turned into trash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:08.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,pandas, Dallas, Texas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:10.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,longhorns, raccoons, tiny
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:11.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,hands, big dreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:12.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,and a one-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:13.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,and-nine record.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.34,0:00:14.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,longhorns, a full
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:15.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,ton of brisket-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.82,0:00:17.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,fed bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.10,0:00:18.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,they don't run routes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.32,0:00:19.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,they run you over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.72,0:00:20.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Dallas got the ball
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.40,0:00:22.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,six times, six touchdowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.98,0:00:24.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,every drive, another
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.24,0:00:25.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,trash can went flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:27.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,touchdown, trash can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:29.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,touchdown, trash can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.06,0:00:29.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,the cleanup crew
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.64,0:00:31.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,asked for overtime pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.56,0:00:32.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,Dallas never punted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.84,0:00:33.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,not once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:34.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,the punter brought
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.58,0:00:35.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,a lawn chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:36.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,the raccoon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.06,0:00:37.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,quarterback got bulldozed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.28,0:00:38.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,five times, straight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.84,0:00:40.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,into the dumpster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.12,0:00:41.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,every time the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.02,0:00:43.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,lid slammed shut, clang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.18,0:00:44.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,then a fumble and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,a longhorn rumbled 70
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:46.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,yards with a raccoon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:47.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,hanging off his leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.78,0:00:48.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,the whole stadium
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.98,0:00:50.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,had one chant,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.50,0:00:53.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,take out the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:00:54.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,fans waved garbage
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.02,0:00:55.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,bags like rally towels.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.86,0:00:56.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,fair is fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.60,0:00:58.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,the raccoons scored 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.26,0:00:58.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,they still
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:00.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,lost by 21.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.16,0:01:00.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,so they grabbed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.72,0:01:01.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,a cold pizza, climbed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.90,0:01:02.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,into the can
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.54,0:01:04.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,and closed the lid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.26,0:01:05.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,one and nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.42,0:01:06.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,Eagles, you're
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.06,0:01:07.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,next on Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.24,0:01:07.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,who's taking out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.74,0:01:08.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,the trash after that?
